<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Fraser Alexander ups half year shr, div.</title>
<headline>Fraser Alexander ups half year shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     77.9	  vs 63.8</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 17.0	  vs 14.0</p>
<p>    Income pre-tax	  22.72	 vs 15.39</p>
<p>    Tax			 9.02	  vs 3.17</p>
<p>    Turnover		  264.68	vs 257.54</p>
<p>Div payable April 18</p>
<p>on register April 4</p>
<p>Full name: Fraser Alexander Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said improvement in earnings in the first six months by the bulk materials handling, concrete products and mining services divisions is expected to continue, whilst the losses from its share in the metal benefication business are expected to decline substantially.</p>
<p>It said the sale of its colliery interests and the conversion of Waste-tech into a substantial investment in the enlarged Enviroserv have improved the group's focus and advanced it towards its strategic objectives.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
